      "cooked": "<p>From the admin account I have assigned only one specific company for my user. From my user account I am able to see only that company in List View, Image View etc. But when i check in Tree View than it is also showing all other companies as well bypassing or not checking user permissions.</p>\n<p>I am also attaching the screenshots for better understanding.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/f/afcbc81cb97f13c4eac7de36296fe90dbaef785d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/afcbc81cb97f13c4eac7de36296fe90dbaef785d\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-09-01 104856\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/f/afcbc81cb97f13c4eac7de36296fe90dbaef785d_2_690x314.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-09-01 104856\" data-base62-sha1=\"p5a9LKfrn2XhqnGv1pdjFMg3dDf\" width=\"690\" height=\"314\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/f/afcbc81cb97f13c4eac7de36296fe90dbaef785d_2_690x314.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/f/afcbc81cb97f13c4eac7de36296fe90dbaef785d_2_1035x471.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/f/afcbc81cb97f13c4eac7de36296fe90dbaef785d_2_1380x628.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"92BCEA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-09-01 104856</span><span class=\"informations\">1919×875 76.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/8/6/86298af625b603b1d23588b66517ae1f49569aa6.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/86298af625b603b1d23588b66517ae1f49569aa6\" title