      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/neelbrahmbhatt\">@NeelBrahmbhatt</a></p>\n<p>Since it is parent company against which you have defined user permission, requires you further to mark <strong>Hide Decedent</strong> checkbox ON if you dont want user to see its child.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/6/d658dbc4fa08142af928d75e65b093942b65298a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/d658dbc4fa08142af928d75e65b093942b65298a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/6/d658dbc4fa08142af928d75e65b093942b65298a_2_690x314.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"uAcyxpCRcDnlwXJcgKjBguHFW66\" width=\"690\" height=\"314\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/6/d658dbc4fa08142af928d75e65b093942b65298a_2_690x314.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/d/6/d658dbc4fa08142af928d75e65b093942b65298a_2_1035x471.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/d/6/d658dbc4fa08142af928d75e65b093942b65298a.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"92BBEA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1035×471 33.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
